Parts of this project are derived from MIT-licensed work by others:

  - lib/crypto.js and lib/reader.js carry a port of the WeRead web reader
    encoding implemented in dsh-weread by wwjzzy (https://github.com/wwjzzy/dsh-weread),
    which in turn follows taincheng's implementation
    (https://github.com/taincheng/dsh-weread).
  - lib/qrcode-generator.cjs is QR Code Generator for JavaScript
    by Kazuhiko Arase (MIT).
